{# Homepage hero backdrop: drifting signal dots. Nothing else.
   No lattice, no connecting lines, no hub — just a few cyan marks following
   curved paths at different speeds, so the motion reads as signals moving
   through space rather than along rails.

   These use SVG's own <animateMotion> rather than CSS offset-path. offset-path
   works, but its coordinates do not compose with the viewBox transform, so the
   dots rendered hundreds of pixels outside the hero. animateMotion lives in the
   SVG user coordinate system, so it scales with the viewBox for free.

   PLACEMENT MATTERS. The viewBox is 1440x900, chosen to sit close to the hero's real aspect. It used to be 1440x620, and because
   `slice` scales to COVER, that upscaled the art 1.4x and cropped ~210 units off
   each side, throwing three of the seven dots outside the hero entirely. Paths run
   through the top band, the bottom band and the outer margins — a cyan dot crossing
   the white headline reads as a rendering artifact rather than as design.

   Each dot is offset by half its size so it CENTRES on its path. #}
<svg class="hero-fx" viewBox="0 0 1440 900" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice"
     aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
  <g class="fx-dots">
    {% set dots = [
      { s: 7, dur: "19s", b: "0s",    p: "M -60 110 C 260 50, 620 175, 1500 100" },
      { s: 6, dur: "26s", b: "-3.5s", p: "M -60 190 C 380 120, 900 245, 1500 158" },
      { s: 5, dur: "15s", b: "-7s",   p: "M -60 60 C 500 -25, 950 150, 1500 42" },
      { s: 7, dur: "23s", b: "-1.5s", p: "M 1500 765 C 1000 855, 500 700, -60 800" },
      { s: 6, dur: "17s", b: "-9s",   p: "M -60 838 C 420 762, 860 872, 1500 792" },
      { s: 5, dur: "21s", b: "-5s",   p: "M 45 -60 C 92 260, 12 620, 58 960" },
      { s: 6, dur: "24s", b: "-12s",  p: "M 1398 960 C 1348 620, 1430 240, 1382 -60" }
    ] %}
    {%- for d in dots %}
    <rect class="fx-dot" x="-{{ d.s / 2 }}" y="-{{ d.s / 2 }}" width="{{ d.s }}" height="{{ d.s }}">
      <animateMotion dur="{{ d.dur }}" begin="{{ d.b }}" repeatCount="indefinite" path="{{ d.p }}"/>
      <animate attributeName="opacity" dur="{{ d.dur }}" begin="{{ d.b }}" repeatCount="indefinite"
               values="0;0.9;0.9;0" keyTimes="0;0.08;0.92;1"/>
    </rect>
    {%- endfor %}
  </g>
</svg>
